Below, we detail each one so that you know them better:
Bipod: improves shooting precision and stability more than the shaft, but can only be used while bent or lying down
Almost all of these accessories have three levels within the game. For example, a level one blade allows you to improve your accuracy a little, while a level three blade improves your aim considerably, making a clear difference in your games.
Its function is to eliminate the sound of the weapon so as not to be discovered and it eliminates the shot mark on the map. This does not increase the damage or range of the firearm.
This increases the damage of your weapon, it also stabilizes your weapon when shooting at long distances. When you use it your weapons are not affected by range or distance.
The x4 sight, on the other hand, is the most popular and has been expanded four times.
We recommend it in specific situations of positioning against the enemy.
In this case compared to the previous ones it is a clear winner. Not only does it maintain accuracy for longer, reducing the scope considerably, but it also reactivates its use faster when entering combat again
Finally we tell you that there are three different goal modes in FREE FIRE: standard, precise aim and total control You can change the game mode in the settings menu. Standard mode:
