It is a totally desert island, here the game begins, when you arrive as a new player it is logical that you will only wear what you wear, you must take care of getting your own equipment. At first you must fly over the island and land anywhere.
In Bermuda it is very likely that you will find the best loot in areas with the highest concentration of buildings or perhaps in industrial areas. In these areas you can find vehicles on the streetsides.
There are many steep areas, you should avoid them whenever necessary as they can be difficult to climb and in the process you can be attacked. In this area it is important to take special care when moving.
Brasilia is the capital of Purgatory. In this area you can find many famous houses among many players, you must move cautiously and be aware of attacks.
This map is new but it is already known by many and there are many players who want to stock up on implements and equipment, there will be areas where many more players will be concentrated and there will be others where you will not find anyone. You decide if you want to fall directly into the action or if you prefer to take a quiet ride.
