What do I do if Free Fire is not working properly?
Operating system: iOS 9 or higher.
Switch from Wi-Fi to mobile data and see which one works best for you.
Try to close the applications that you have in the background, because they consume RAM and internet.
Lower the quality of the graphics to the minimum, by touching the wheel that appears in the upper right corner.
Turn off your modem, and wait 5 seconds before turning it on
To see more details and options, tap the name of the app. You will find types of use of your data:
"Foreground" is the amount of data that the application has used while you are using it.
In that section, go to "Advanced"
Check your internet connection and make sure it is stable.
The loot of the same is distributed in different parts of this area full of places, stops, ramps and blind spots by others. If you are more into strategies like ambushes or sneak attacks, this is the stage for you.
This area is located northwest of Bermuda, in the past it was known under the name of Ranch. This area has several interesting places to find loot, but if you want to find good loot, you should definitely go to the mansion that is north of this stage.
This area is located in the northern part of the island, it is a good region where you can find enough loot both weapons and supplies, in the warehouses located northeast of the area you will get enough weapons while towards the center you can equip yourself with good quantity of supplies. Once equipped, if you want to go to another area of the map, look for a vehicle and escape along the road that is in the southern part.
This area is a small town that is located in the northwestern part of Bermuda, there we can find vehicles such as tuk tuk or jeep in case you want to take the main road that is close to the town, but before this we recommend you explore each of the houses since there you can find enough loot.
Mars electric This area is one of the widest areas on the map of Bermuda, it is a site with several structures with large warehouses where you will not only be able to stock up on enough loot, you will also have many options for attack and escape routes and where to take shelter.
This area consists of a large factory with a multi-story building to the east of the land, to the west you can find the small town of Pochinok where there are several houses and to the south is the Mars Electric plant. From the building you can take a position as a sniper and in the town closed attacks, if you get vehicles you can move through the main road that is near this area.
This is one of the areas where we can find more loot compared to other areas of the map, this is largely due to the fact that Hangar is a military base, so the possibility that you will find level 3 weapons, vests, explosives Helmets is high. If you move around this area you will have to be careful of ambushes but especially of possible snipers located in Clock Tower.
This is a small village through which a dirt road passes, in the garages of the houses you can find vehicles to move around the dirt road and in addition to that, loot of weapons and medical equipment. If you do not get a vehicle, it is better to move to the power station and observe the terrain well from there before going to the town, since to the east being surrounded by trees makes it an ideal setting to receive attacks from enemies.
This area is located in the center of Bermuda, this is the highest terrain of the island, at the top you will find a hotel in ruins where you can find loot. It is an area full of bushes and rocks which makes it ideal for ambushes.
This area is a small island that can be accessed by two bridges that are located at the ends, or by swimming, to the north of the island there is a lighthouse where you can find good loot, we do not recommend staying long in this territory unless that you place yourself on top of the lighthouse as a sniper, the problem is that if you barricade yourself in that area the only way to escape is by swimming and you would be exposed.
