As of yet, there are no abilities that are fully compatible with "Demolishing Art" as it is the only ability related to explosive weapons. However, there are combinations that increase Álvaro's aggressiveness to the point of making him a very dangerous character.
"Bushido", "Career" and "Sustained Hunting": A devastating combination. With Kelly's ability we will be much faster, which will be essential when launching a grenade and starting a confrontation at close range, where we will take advantage of "Sustained Hunting" to eliminate our rival with a submachine gun or shotgun to recover some points of lifetime.
Other Variants: "Bushido" in combo # 1 can be replaced by "Extremely Agile", Caroline's ability; the damage we do will be less, but in return we will get more speed, which can be advantageous in a close-range confrontation. In Combo # 2, we can change "Dealer" to "Bushido" to optimize damage.
Her best friends are Ford and Laura.
Álvaro was created in gratitude to the community of Latin American players, who dominate the competitive circuit.
