The Garena company in many of its communications has promulgated the support for parents, thus offering any type of communication that they require, they also remember that the first thing to do when downloading any application or game is to carefully read the terms and conditions contract.
It is also important that parents get involved and know what their children want to play, in this way they can be advised so that more than a prohibition they receive the guidelines to have a correct and safe gaming experience.
It should always be borne in mind that in the game objects can be acquired with real money, therefore, it is important that if you are a minor or your child is playing, they do not handle their parents' credit cards in the game without prior authorization from them.
