Lately there are many alerts and Bans or Penalties in Qualifying for the AFK. But what does it mean?...
AFK means »Away From KeyBoard» which means, Away from the keyboard, in this case it refers to away from the mobile game, which we are not playing.
The AFK behavior can be due to Lost Connection and your character is AFK, so you will not be playing or a bot will control your account temporarily at that time or you are simply in the game but you do not want to move and you are harming the game experience of the companions , or facilitating advantages in enemies and that is not in Garena's policy AFK Free Fire Warning
