1 level: Using SMG or shotgun to eliminate enemies will restore 25 HP. 5 second cooldown.
3 level: Using SMG or shotgun to eliminate enemies will restore 31 HP. 5 second cooldown.
5 level: Using SMG or shotgun to eliminate enemies will restore 37 HP. 5 second cooldown.
