Although Hayato and Caroline's abilities are the most compatible with Jota's ability, that does not mean that they are the only ones that we can use to take advantage of "Sustained Hunting". As stated before, Jota is a good character to fill extremely offensive roles, a more conservative role, and support roles to help the entire squad.
"Bushido", "Extremely Agile" and "Race": A basic combo, designed to run throughout the island exterminating enemies without rest. More speed, more power, and more life points.
"Career", "Extremely Agile" and "Hacker's Eye": It is an alternative to the first combo. We will not do as much damage, but thanks to Moco's ability we can track an enemy that we shoot from afar so that it does not escape us.
Other variants: In combo No. 2 we can replace "Seductive Movement" with "Career" or "Extremely Agile" if we do not want to be faster just to defend ourselves.
