"Refugio de Pintura" is the exclusive ability of this character, and is considered one of the worst so far. With it, Steffie paints a 5-meter area that reduces damage from explosives and bullets, with a fairly short cooldown time.
It is useful for both Solo and squad battles, but one of the big problems with this ability is that it remains static in the place where it was activated. It doesn't follow us like Alok's "Brutal Rhythm" circle and this is a huge disadvantage since we can't move if we want to enjoy damage reduction.
Another point against is that bullet damage does not decrease much, it remains at 5% at all levels, and that is not a very noticeable damage reduction.
In his favor, it goes without saying that as long as the circle is active, the vest doesn't take any damage, but even this doesn't make it a profitable skill. Regardless of the damage from the bullets, the difference would be made simply by the circle following us.
1 level: Paint a 5-meter area that reduces explosive damage by 15% and bullet damage by 5% for 5 seconds. 45 second cooldown.
3 level: Paint a 5-meter area that reduces explosive damage by 19% and bullet damage by 5% for 7 seconds. 45 second cooldown.
5 level: Paint a 5-meter area that reduces explosive damage by 23% and bullet damage by 5% for 9 seconds. 45 second cooldown.
It is possible to place a gloo wall and activate the ability to protect ourselves, but only as a precaution. We don't need to get out of the circle; it is enough to wait for our rival to approach to assassinate him without losing too much life, and in case he drops a grenade, we can receive it without so much fear.
"Repair Team" can support Steffie's ability, but we still can't get much of an advantage because of its situational nature. Some combos that can support the skill are the following:
"Repair Team", "Gluttony" and "Mafia Spirit": A combination designed to resist as much time as possible. Since the vest does not take damage if we are inside "Refuge of Painting", thanks to Shani's ability we can increase the level of the vest with a pair of kill, preventing them from lowering our lives when we do not have graffiti painted.
One of the Internet pages dedicated to giving news about the game in Brazil, claimed that Steffie would be the first black female character to be incorporated into the game.
