Many people were eager to learn about this new update and this great moment was expected for a long time. Fortunately the game's developers did not disappoint their players, as many have expressed their complete approval and excitement at Kalahari's inclusion in the game.
Let's do a small count of the best places in Kalahari. This place is small but the fights are not proportional to its size, in this place the battles are very strong, so prepare to know and survive in this new place.
Kalahari has many advantages but it is still in constant renovation since it is considered relatively new. This map is much smaller compared to Bermuda, which is the largest map in the game.
Short distances are not a problem
Within this game one of the main considerations that must be had is where it will land, this depends on the type of game of each player. The areas that Kalahari has are ideal for any player, so the unknown where to land is erased.
In this place you can find many towers and several closed corridors. Along this terrain you can find many valuable and necessary gifts to continue in the game, for this reason many people decide to land in this place and begin an exploratory process in search of equipment.
The variant is that the buildings are smaller which are closed, in this way it is a little safer to move around the place without having surprises. These two areas are very chaotic, many players land here looking for supplies, so be very careful if you decide to start with one of them.
Along the expanse of the Kalahari there are small areas where players decide to stop to search for supplies. The big disadvantage is that these areas are very exposed and attacks can come from anywhere, so try to avoid them, it is not a good idea if you have little equipment.
In the surroundings of this area there are a large number of tents and within them you can find countless resources, equipment and weapons very useful to continue the battle. The main structure of El Sub is a huge submarine which is trapped between two large mountains, in this place there is a great possibility of finding long weapons.
Pistols are almost always filler weapons due to their poor characteristics. They are used early in the game when we have nothing better, but that does not mean they are bad weapons, in fact, they could get us out of more than one trouble.
Pistols are created for shooting at short distances due to their short range. Only the M500 it has a good range followed by the Desert EagleBut their precision makes them useless for long-range shooting.
Accessories Guns cannot be equipped with the astil nor look at it, and only USP Allows you to equip the silencer, the muzzle to improve damage, and the cartridge to improve the amount of ammunition you can carry.
In short, pistols are only good for when we have nothing better, and to participate in challenges where all weapons are prohibited, except pistols.
It has good firepower, range, and charge speed, but its precision is what prevents it from using this weapon to shoot distant enemies. Also, its five-round cartridge is another reason why we should think twice before taking a shot.
The USP is the most basic pistol of all. Some classify it as the worst of the Free Fire pistols, but the truth is that it is very good when we just fall into the map.
