He is also known as a casanova who knows how to take advantage of his charms to get what he wants. In battle, his best weapon is to make his opponent believe he has the upper hand, but he always coldly calculates his every move to get away with it.
His special ability "Seductive Movement" increases his movement speed for 1 second when taking damage, making him one of the most elusive characters in the game, since he quickly escapes from places where he is in danger.
One second may not be enough to get away or get the upper hand on an opponent, so it takes a lot of practice to learn how to take advantage of the skill. Likewise, that second can make a huge difference if the player is used to playing with Joseph, especially if combined with the skills mentioned above.
1 level: Increases movement speed by 10% when taking damage.
Joseph is also quite useful in rusheos, especially in the short range to have Caroline's ability equipped. If they counterattack you, you can take a position that favors you during the second in which "Seductive Movement" is activated, since your opponent will have to adjust her sight to be able to reach you, and this you can easily take advantage of to.
And even without having the skills of Kelly and Caroline, Joseph is a very agile character who is not so easy to take down.
While Caroline's "Extremely Agile" and Kelly's "Career" are the two skills that Joseph is best suited to, they are not the only options available to him to emerge victorious in their matches.
"Armor Specialist", "Repair Team" and "Sustained Hunting": With Andrew's ability the bulletproof vests are more resistant, with Shani's, a part of the vest is repaired every time you do one kill, and thanks to Jota's you can recover life if you use submachine gun or shotgun. It's a viable combo if you're looking for durability.
"Hacker's Eye", "Carrera" and "Audacious Shooter": This combo is more for squad battles, but it is still an interesting option for only if you don't like to lose sight of the targets you hunt from a distance.
"Race", "Extremely Agile" and "Sustained Hunting": This is for sure the best possible combination if you are an aggressive player. You will be the fastest in the game and you will be able to recover life points every time you kill a target.
