But why do many full-color LED displays appear color difference?
It can not be corrected by the later correction equipment, but only by the production and manufacturing process of full-color LED display screen manufacturers.
The driving components of are usually constant current driving chips, such as mbl5026.
The output error of the same chip is controlled within 3%, and the output error of different chips is controlled within 6%.
