Outdoor LED full-color screen to do a good job in lightning protection, this is very important.
I don’t have to remember the thunder when it was the least powerful.
Lightning voltage is very high, can reach 100 million to 1 billion volts!
When the lightning is released, the charge of charged cloud decreases rapidly, which causes electrostatic induction and electromagnetic induction in the metal conductor about 2km around the lightning occurrence point, and forms high voltage or instantaneous impulse current inside the conductor.
It is better to install a good grounding lightning rod 5 meters higher than the screen body near the screen body (the lightning rod should not be installed on the screen structure, it is not lightning protection, but lightning, remember to remember), to prevent lightning from directly hitting the screen.
