What is the development prospect of customized LED display_ Customized LED display screen manufacturer LED display
Why does LED display have to be grounded?
Our LED display switch power supply is a device which converts AC (AC) 220V municipal power into DC 5V DC power supply stably output by a series of means such as filtering, rectification, pulse modulation, output rectification and filtering.
To ensure the stability of AC220V input, all power sources will have filter leakage in operation, and the leakage current of single power supply is about 3.5ma.
Under the condition that led display screen is not grounded, leakage current may not only cause chip damage or lamp tube burn.
If the leakage protection is not connected and the LED display screen is not grounded, the leakage current superimposed by the power supply will exceed the human safety current.
After grounding, the voltage of power supply shell is close to 0 to human body.
Therefore, the LED display must be grounded.
LED display is led and drive chip, which belongs to the integration of microelectronics products.
It is believed that the power supply is locked on the box, and the boxes are connected with each other with the lock lock, so the LED display structure grounding means the power supply is also grounded;
It is considered that the lower end of the column structure of outdoor LED display is connected with the earth, so it is not necessary to make the LED display grounding.
Our LED display column is connected with the foundation anchor bolt, and the anchor bolt is embedded in the concrete.
It will lead to the weakening of the effect of structure grounding and even complete failure.
The safety accidents such as leakage current electric shock and chip being disturbed and damaged are caused.
