How does the interference light of LED display screen produce?
One, its own factors: outdoor LED display has the characteristics of high brightness, if the brightness output of LED display screen reaches 8000CD / m2 at dark night, it will cause serious light interference.
Thirdly, illumination influence: there is obvious difference between the ambient illuminance during the day and at night, which will cause the LED display screen with the same brightness to produce different degrees of interference light in different periods of time.
For example, regular contact with photosensitizers or eye disease viewers, will be more sensitive to light.
Broadcast content: if the image content displayed on the LED display screen changes too fast, it will easily cause discomfort to the viewer; if the color brightness is too high and the transition is too rigid, it will also cause discomfort to the human eyes.
due to the different nature of the place, the evaluation standard of interference light is also different.
If the environmental conditions are relatively bad, such as haze, dust, fog, rainstorm, gale and other weather, it will affect people’s judgment of LED display interference light.
