The manufacturers of LED display screen summarized the following three quality problems:
The importance of electrostatic control in the welding process of LED display screen is insufficient for other links.
Therefore, in the process of LED display production and installation, we must pay attention to anti-static control to avoid damage to LED display.
There are also many quality problems in the welding process of LED display screen, which are mainly reflected in the following points: first, the enterprise’s electrostatic prevention and control management is not in place; second, the control of temperature and air humidity in the application of LED display screen is unreasonable; third, the control of LED display component welding time is not good; fourth, there are quality problems in welding materials; fifth, there are no welding personnel
The reason for this phenomenon is that the welding personnel do not reasonably control the welding time and temperature, which leads to the fog in the LED display screen, and then affects the brightness of the display screen.
In addition, the welding enterprise can set up an incentive mechanism within the welding personnel to give certain material or spiritual rewards to the excellent performance employees, so as to improve the enthusiasm and enthusiasm of welding personnel.
However, from the actual situation, many LED display manufacturers do not carry out aging treatment on the display screen, so it is impossible to find the quality problems of LED display screen, and can not take countermeasures for quality problems.
If the LED display screen is not aged, it will not only affect the quality of LED display, but also increase the maintenance and maintenance cost of LED display screen, thus reducing the economic benefits of application enterprises.
