What to do if the clarity of LED full-color display is not enough?
Four ways to improve the definition of full color LED display screen:
&Second, improve the gray level of full-color LED display
The higher the gray level of the full-color LED display screen, the richer the color, the more gorgeous the color; on the contrary, the display color is single and the change is simple.
Now many manufacturers of full-color LED display screen can make the gray level of the display screen 14 bit ~ 16 bit, so that the image level can distinguish the details and display effect more delicate, realistic and colorful.
&Reducing the dot spacing of full-color LED display can improve the clarity of the display screen, because the smaller the dot spacing is, the higher the pixel density per unit area of the full-color LED display screen, the more details can be displayed, and the more delicate and realistic the screen display will be.
The video processor image scaling algorithm is used to ensure that the video image after zooming can maintain the image clarity and gray level to the greatest extent; in addition, the video processor is also required to have rich image adjustment options and adjustment effects to process the brightness, contrast and gray of the image to ensure that the full-color LED display screen outputs soft and clear pictures.
