There are two main technical approaches to solve the inconsistency of LED display screen parameter performance: one is to further subdivide the parameter specifications of LED display screen to improve the consistency of various performance of LED display screen; the other is to improve the uniformity of the display screen by subsequent correction.
Among them, the inconsistency of optical axis, the inconsistent distribution curve of light intensity, the inconsistent attenuation characteristics, poor assembly accuracy and the design irregularity can not be eliminated by subsequent correction, even the inconsistency in optical axis, attenuation and assembly accuracy will be worsened.
