Due to the increase of the rated leakage action current or the decrease of the protection sensitivity, when the leakage fault occurs, the last level leakage protector does not act, and the upper level leakage protector may act.
Therefore, it is necessary to power on the display box in batches as much as possible.
However, as the final leakage protection, the rated leakage action current should not be greater than 30mA.
The layout of leakage protector is unreasonable; Due to the special reasons, such as the leakage protection device in the LED box, the leakage protector is not installed in accordance with the actual situation Gate.
In this way, the influence of surge voltage, surge current and electromagnetic interference on the total leakage protector can be greatly reduced, and the selectivity and reliability of the action of the total leakage protector can be improved.
The final leakage protector in the switch box is the main protection of electrical equipment.
Because there are many metal conductors and many wire joints in the LED full-color display screen, if the wire insulation is not very good, it will lead to frequent leakage; some also add some sockets, in many cases, leakage protector is not installed, which often causes leakage.
current leakage protectors, whether electromagnetic or electronic, use magnetic induction voltage transformer to pick up the leakage current in the main circuit of electrical equipment, three-phase or three-phase four wire can not be completely balanced in the magnetic ring.
Under high current or high overvoltage, a certain electromotive force will be induced in the magnetic ring with high permeability.
The larger the rated current is, the larger the leakage flux will be, and the leakage current must overcome the magnetization force of the magnetic ring itself.
