I. daily inspection: “daily inspection” refers to daily inspection of relevant display equipment, and timely handle the hidden dangers as possible.
(1) reinforcement inspection of internal components and steel frame structure: when being warned by natural disasters such as weather deterioration, the stability and safety of each component of screen body shall be checked, especially for each small and small part of steel structure.
In addition, LED full color display is a high-power equipment.
The terminal of power supply part will be loose due to cold and hot, and the contact is not firm, forming a virtual connection, which will generate heat in serious cases, even lead to the plastic elements nearby.
Therefore, the connector of LED full color display must be fixed regularly.
(2) inspection of lightning protection facilities: regularly check the lightning rod and grounding line, and test the facilities after thunderstorm.
(3) inspection of control system of LED full color display: regularly check the system reliability to ensure its normal operation; for all lines and equipment of large screen, regular inspection shall be carried out to avoid unexpected situation.
In order to ensure safety, the grounding of the power box must be normal, and the power supply line shall be checked regularly to avoid the line damage.
