Synchronization refers to the real-time change of the contents of the computer screen displayed synchronously by full color LED display screen, and asynchronous refers to the fixed content that has been sent on the card by the full color LED display screen.
Judging whether the full color LED display is synchronous or asynchronous display, it can be used according to its purpose: for example, if the train station displays the remaining tickets, it needs to be updated in real time and synchronized.
The synchronous display of CRT refers to that the display content of full color LED display can reflect the display content on the CRT display in real time and synchronously.
The receiving card in the control system of full color LED display is best one receiving card for a box.
refers to the computer sending the edited content to the receiving card of the full color LED display screen through communication program.
as like as two peas in computer display, the synchronous control system is the control system of full-color LED display screen in real time with the full color LED display and the real-time display of the computer display.
For example, the control systems such as lingxingyu, depda and Nova are all synchronous control systems.
The asynchronous control system is also called offline control system.
The normal display of full color LED display will not be affected after the computer is shut down.
