LED display manufacturers take you to understand the LED display pixel Technology:
Each LED cell reproduces the corresponding primary color information of several adjacent pixels in a time-division multiplexing manner.
Virtual pixel Technology: in the display system, when the displayed information scrolls in a certain way in a certain direction, a series of moving and physically nonexistent virtual pixels will be generated between two adjacent pixels by using the characteristics of human transient visual effect, so as to adjust each LED single tube to enhance the resolution of led full-color display screen and achieve the best image effect It can improve the image resolution, which is generally 4 times.
It can be understood that multiple pixels in the signal source share a complete independent pixel of the display terminal in the way of time division multiplexing.
