According to Phoenix City media, they will try to achieve more media value and customer value in the future.
At present, most of the LED display media companies are still busy with the acquisition of screen resources and the initial stage of customer development and sales, and have no energy or strength to build industry standards and LED display media monitoring system.
In its Research Report on the value of China’s outdoor LED large screen media, Analysys International pointed out that the monitoring system and effect evaluation were not perfect, which led to the underestimation of the value of the new media form by the capital side and advertisers; the degree of market integration was not enough, and the fierce competition reduced the bargaining power.
At present, Phoenix City media has started to cooperate with the third-party media monitoring institutions to carry out exploratory attempts, hoping to build LED display media evaluation index system with peers.
